  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. It&rsquo;s given that <math alttext=\"4 x equals 3\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math> yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"24 x equals 18\"><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>6</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"8 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>8</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"96 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>96</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>",
